ENTRY            M0162   20261016   20261127   20261127       M149
SUBENT        M0162001   20261016   20261127   20261127       M149
BIB                 13         41
TITLE      Decay characteristics of the giant dipole resonance
            in K-39.
AUTHOR     (U.R.Arzibekov,A.S.Gabelko,M.Kh.Zhalilov,K.M.Irgashev,
           B.S.Ishkhanov,I.M.Kapitonov,I.M.Piskarev)
REFERENCE  (J,BAS,51,124,1987)
            English translation of IZV,51,134,1987.
           (J,IZV,51,134,1987)
INSTITUTE  (4RUSMOS)
FACILITY   (BETAT,4RUSMOS)
INC-SOURCE (BRST)
METHOD     (EXTB,SITA)
DETECTOR   (GELI) 100-cm3 GE(LI) detector.
PART-DET   (G) Gamma detection at 140 deg.
ERR-ANALYS (ERR-S) Statistical errors are given.
COMMENT    Measured gamma-spectra   from   K-39(g,pg')Ar-38  and
            K-39(g,ng')K-38 reactions induced by  bremsstrahlung
            gamma-quanta with 32 MeV end-point energy.
           Integrated cross sections of  photonucleon  reactions
            on  K-39  with formation of final nuclei in separate
            states were determined based on an analysis  of  the
            experimental data.
           It is found that  for  this  nuclei  the  semi-direct
            decay  probability  for GDR in the (gamma,p) channel
            amounts to 0.46 - 0.56 and the (gamma,n) it is 0.95.
           Determination  of  the  nature  of  gamma line, i.e.
            identification of transitions between levels of the
            final nuclei leading to appearance of maxima in the
            spectrum,   was   achieved   taking   into  account
            information as cascade gamma transitions.
STATUS     (APRVD) By A.S.Gabelko.
           The data in form of the tables were received
            from the authors.
HISTORY    (19870619C)
           (19910202A) Corrected by V.Varlamov, V.Mclane.
           (20140716A) Corrected  by  V.Varlamov:   REFERENCE,
            FACILITY, STATUS, BRS -> BRA, dates, lowercase.
           (20220124U) Corrected by V.Varlamov: PART-DET, COMMENT
            in SUBENTs 002, 003, STATUS.
           (20220425U) Corrected by V.Varlamov: REACTION.
           (20261016A) Corrected by V.Varlamov: TITLE, AUTHOR,
            REFERENCE, PART-DET, COMMENT, REACTION, DATA, STATUS.
ENDBIB              41
COMMON               2          3
ANG        EN-MAX
ADEG       MEV
   140.        32.
ENDCOMMON            3
